{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Dev, Maximum Value</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fast-paced Roguelike card game with simple rules!</strong><br>\u00a0 \u2022 No complex resource costs. Play cards immediately when drawn!<br>\u00a0 \u2022 Build your own deck. No filler cards!<br>\u00a0 \u2022 Focus on combat, not map navigation. Pure strategic battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689680/extras/d795f83d87c3383e2a4f1917246b573c.poster.avif?t=1752215443\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689680/extras/d795f83d87c3383e2a4f1917246b573c.webm?t=1752215443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689680/extras/d795f83d87c3383e2a4f1917246b573c.mp4?t=1752215443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Affordable price, uncompromised quality.</strong><br>\u00a0 \u2022 Unique visual effects for every card ability<br>\u00a0 \u2022 200+ unique card effects ensure endless replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689680/extras/49f96d4972d1ecffeb4e510a2bdbaad8.poster.avif?t=1752215443\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689680/extras/49f96d4972d1ecffeb4e510a2bdbaad8.webm?t=1752215443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689680/extras/49f96d4972d1ecffeb4e510a2bdbaad8.mp4?t=1752215443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_pa